    <h1>Don't See Your County?</h1>
    <p>OpenVoterGuide is growing! Help us decide where to expand next by requesting your county. Every request helps us understand where voters need better access to election information.</p>
  </header>

  <aside class="request-county-note" aria-label="About county requests">
    <h2>Your request makes a difference</h2>
    <p>Requests help us prioritize future expansion, but they do not guarantee that a county will be added.</p>
    <p><strong>Privacy:</strong> Your request helps us understand where voters want OpenVoterGuide to expand. If you choose to provide an email address, it will only be used for the purposes disclosed in the form. Google Forms processes your submission.</p>
  </aside>

